    "title": "Johnson County overdose deaths increase as Kentucky reports fourth year of decline - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mycca Decker News Editor ,\n10 hours ago Johnson County reported six overdose deaths in 2025, up from fewer than five in 2024, while Kentucky overdose deaths declined for the fourth year in a row, according to Gov. Andy Beshear’s office and the 2025 Kentucky Drug Overdose Fatality Report. Statewide, Kentucky saw a 22.9 percent decrease in... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
